      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ああぁっ！　シルバさん！　丁度いいときに会いました！\nお願いします助けてください！　みんなが僕の貞操を……！",
      "jp_sha256": "bb8d9ff4866e4b8abb2323d31ac2376adc06e9659d05a34d5b5627b78df5a82c",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아아앗! 실바 씨! 마침 잘 만났어요!\n부탁이에요, 도와주세요! 다들 제 정조를……!",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 12,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b006-20261106-same-model-pass2-r1",
